Does this compile?
```rust
fn main() {
    let v = vec![1, 2, 3];
    let first = &v[0];
    v.push(4);
    println!("{first}");
}
```

Which selector wins?
```css
a.link { color: red; }
#nav a { color: blue; }
```

What is <code>total</code> after this runs?
```typescript
const prices: number[] = [1.10, 2.20];
const total = prices.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0);
```

What does this C snippet print?
```c
#include <stdio.h>

int main(void) {
    int a[] = {1, 2, 3};
    printf("%zu\n", sizeof(a) / sizeof(a[0]));
    return 0;
}
```

Why is the copy constructor deleted here?
```cpp
struct Handle {
    Handle(const Handle&) = delete;
    Handle& operator=(const Handle&) = delete;
    Handle(Handle&&) noexcept = default;
};
```
